01:07:16.600 --> 01:07:18.600
The thing is that

01:07:18.600 --> 01:07:20.600
this whole path

01:07:20.600 --> 01:07:22.600
that you are sending

01:07:22.600 --> 01:07:24.600
some requests

01:07:24.600 --> 01:07:26.600
or the server is sending you a response

