this is basically through the internet.

01:07:30.600 --> 01:07:32.600
And you know that the internet runs

01:07:32.600 --> 01:07:34.600
on the HTTP protocol.

01:07:34.600 --> 01:07:36.600
So in the HTTP

01:07:36.600 --> 01:07:38.600
you basically interact with the network.

01:07:38.600 --> 01:07:40.600
So let me tell you

01:07:40.600 --> 01:07:42.600
what is the entire layer

01:07:42.600 --> 01:07:44.600
in the APIs.

01:07:44.600 --> 01:07:46.600
So if I talk about the network layer

01:07:48.600 --> 01:07:50.600
then the network layer is

01:07:50.600 --> 01:07:52.600
your HTTP protocol.

01:07:52.600 --> 01:07:54.600
And

01:07:54.600 --> 01:07:56.600
here you have a backend.

01:07:56.600 --> 01:07:58.600
Backend is basically

01:07:58.600 --> 01:08:00.600
your application.

01:08:02.600 --> 01:08:04.600
And this application is on the server side.

01:08:06.600 --> 01:08:08.600
Like in our case

01:08:08.600 --> 01:08:10.600
our rag application.

01:08:10.600 --> 01:08:12.600
Where will our rag application

01:08:12.600 --> 01:08:14.600
